# Core

- Read `AGENTS.md`, [docs/01-vision.md](../../docs/01-vision.md), [governance.mdc](governance.mdc), [goal-execution.mdc](goal-execution.mdc), and the active goal file `docs/07-backlog/goals/G-xxx.md` (index: `docs/07-backlog/goals.md`) before coding.
- Respect `docs/02-product/mvp-scope.md` — do not build out-of-scope features without a new goal.
- **Only execute `ready` goals** — see goal status flow in [governance.mdc](governance.mdc).
- Smallest correct diff; no drive-by refactors; stay within goal **Touch map**.
- Follow [security.mdc](security.mdc) — no secrets in repo; no prod commands without human approval.
- Follow [artifact-conservation.mdc](artifact-conservation.mdc) — discussion ≠ implementation; no new artifacts without explicit command.
- Follow [platform-consumer.mdc](platform-consumer.mdc) — platform stays generic; no consumer product names in this repo.
